Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:47.51,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8\bord0.5\blur3\pos(960,628)\i1\3c&H0C0D10&}呀、真多{\fsp0}汁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.51,0:15:48.76,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8\bord0.5\blur3\pos(960,628)\i1\3c&H0C0D10&}不愧是我的心{\fsp0}臟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:49.76,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8\bord0.5\blur3\pos(960,628)\i1\3c&H0C0D10&}活力十{\fsp0}足
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:50.76,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8\bord0.5\blur3\pos(960,628)\i1\3c&H0C0D10&}不過是死{\fsp0}的
